          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.829,
            0.719,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Justify why AB in Fig. 6.4 is the perpendicular bisector."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.854,
            0.8,
            0.894
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Can you think of different methods to construct a 90° angle at a given point on a line using a rope?"
            }
          ]
        },
